  "evidence_quotes": [
    "Ditheon is man evolved to bilateral hemispheric parity, + Ditheon is Christ. In which case I am equating the evolutionary leap to bilateral hemispheric parity with man becoming Christ himself",
    "Maybe my speeding up (+ meta-abstracting) did not just cause me to perceive world as jumping back to ancient times. rather, in relation to me it was the time of Acts, with 'time of Acts' defined as a certain [rather slow] change-rate; after all, velocity is relative.",
    "What it means is: it is becoming more viable progressively, passing not from birth to ultimate death but from rigidity (non-life) toward absolute + total life as a limit.",
